OL,3,GNEWSACouncil urges park visitors to
OL,4,Astop feeding geese
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh Peak Borough Council has urged
OL,7,Fpeople to stop feeding Canada geese at
OL,8,Fa park in Buxton.
OL,10,FThe council said numbers of the
OL,11,Fnon-native species had "grown
OL,12,Fsignificantly" in the summer at the
OL,13,FPavilion Gardens, partly due to "people
OL,14,Fcontinuing to feed the birds despite
OL,15,Frepeated requests by the council not
OL,16,Fto".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
