OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil urges park visitors to
OL,4,Astop feeding geese
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Labour-run authority,
OL,7,Fas well as having a "significant
OL,8,Fnegative impact" on the cleanliness of
OL,9,Fthe play areas, paths and grassed
OL,10,Fspaces, the birds' droppings carried
OL,11,Fbacteria, including E. coli, which
OL,12,Fcould pose a health risk.
OL,14,FIt said it was increasing cleaning of
OL,15,Fthe worst affected areas and
OL,16,Fintroducing sanitising stations in
OL,17,Fhigh-use locations.
